DlbDcfPriorityLiquidationEngine::setMarketOnce()
├── given market is already set
│   └── it should revert with DlbDcfPriorityLiquidationEngineInvalidInput
└── given market is not set
    ├── when _market is address(0)
    │   └── it should revert with DlbDcfPriorityLiquidationEngineInvalidInput
    └── when _market is not address(0)
        ├── when msg.sender is not _market
        │   └── it should revert with DlbDcfPriorityLiquidationEngineLiquidationUnauthorized
        └── when msg.sender is _market
            └── it should set market successfully
                └── it should emit SetMarketOnce event